# GitHub account (this repo)

`origin` is `https://github.com/bluecollarvideoguys/bluecollarvideoguys-site.git`.

The GitHub user that can push is **bluecollarvideoguys**. Login is **bluecollarvideoguys@gmail.com** with **Google sign-in**. It is not Luma, not `lumafilms`, and not `cokerkathy`.

- Prefer `~/.local/bin/gh` if `gh` is not on PATH.
